<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CEI Citicorp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CEI Citicorp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns analysts Santiago Pique and Marc McCarthy have started coverage of Argentina's CEI Citicorp Holdings SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a June 21 report, they set an 18-month target price of $7, a 25 percent appreciation over current levels.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company, which has media and telecommunications holdings in Argentina, closed Monday at 5.5 pesos in Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
